Description: Provides tools for structuring, visualising, and forecasting
    betting market odds data. This package converts raw betting odds into
    'bettr_data' objects via the make_bettr() function.  Plotting methods
    visualise odds movements over time with interactive tooltips, while
    prediction methods apply time-series forecasting approaches including
    ARIMA, exponential smoothing (ETS), and Skellam-based models to
    betting odds trajectories. The package includes a built-in dataset of
    1,573 observations from 10 English Premier League 2025 matches for
    demonstration purposes.
